OL,3,GNEWSAWaitrose's staff gym to open to
OL,4,Ageneral public
OL,5,
OL,6,FWaitrose has been given permission to
OL,7,Fopen its private sports and leisure
OL,8,Fclub to the general public.
OL,10,FThe supermarket chain has been based in
OL,11,FBracknell since 1972 and its club in
OL,12,FWilloughby Road can be used by all of
OL,13,Fits 2,700 staff based in the town.
OL,15,FIt said last year that about 620 people
OL,16,Fwere members, down from about 800 five
OL,17,Fyears before that, and that the
OL,18,Ffacility was "significantly
OL,19,Funder-utilised".
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
