OL,3,GNEWSAWaitrose's staff gym to open to
OL,4,Ageneral public
OL,5,
OL,6,FBracknell Forest Council approved
OL,7,FWaitrose's plan on Thursday but said
OL,8,Fwork must be done first to make sure
OL,9,Fits car park is safe for users.
